<div class="pol-tldr"><b>the short version</b><ul><li>we collect only what we need to deliver your order and talk to you</li><li>your card and UPI details go to Razorpay; we never see or store them</li><li>we never sell your personal data</li></ul></div>
<h2>who we are</h2>
<p>SuperState ("we", "us") runs superstate.in and sells Sleep Well. If you have any question about your data, contact us on <a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' }}">WhatsApp 95673 09388</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ settings.support_email }}">{{ settings.support_email }}</a>.</p>
<h2>what we collect</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Order details:</b> your name, WhatsApp number, email, delivery address, pincode, city and state, the pack you chose, and any discount or creator code you used.</li>
<li><b>Payment details:</b> handled on Shopify's secure checkout and processed by Razorpay. We receive a payment confirmation and payment ID, never your full card number, CVV or UPI PIN.</li>
<li><b>Website usage:</b> pages visited and actions like viewing the product, starting checkout or completing a purchase, collected through cookies and similar tools (Meta Pixel and Google Tag Manager).</li>
<li><b>Messages:</b> anything you send us on WhatsApp or email.</li>
</ul>
<h2>how we use it</h2>
<ul>
<li>To process, ship and support your order, including WhatsApp updates and tracking.</li>
<li>To credit the creator whose code or link you used.</li>
<li>To understand what's working on our website and in our ads, and to show relevant ads on Meta and Google platforms.</li>
<li>To respond to your questions, returns and refunds, and to meet legal and tax obligations.</li>
</ul>
<h2>who we share it with</h2>
<p>We share data only with the services that help us run the business: Shopify (our store and checkout), Razorpay (payments), our courier partners (delivery), Google (order records and analytics), and Meta (ad measurement). We do <b>not</b> sell your personal data.</p>
<h2>cookies and tracking</h2>
<p>We use the Meta Pixel and Google Tag Manager to measure visits and purchases. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, and use ad-preference settings on Meta and Google to limit personalised ads.</p>
<h2>how long we keep it</h2>
<p>We keep order records for as long as needed to serve you and to meet accounting and legal requirements, and then delete or anonymise them.</p>
<h2>your choices</h2>
<p>You can ask us to show, correct or delete your personal data, or to stop contacting you, at any time via <a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' }}">WhatsApp 95673 09388</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ settings.support_email }}">{{ settings.support_email }}</a>.</p>
<h2>changes</h2>
<p>If we change this policy, we'll update this page and the date below.</p>
